  & $122.5{\scriptstyle\pm53.2}$  & $\mathbf{131.4{\scriptstyle\pm18.4}}$
  & $-156.0{\scriptstyle\pm7.8}$  & $-174.3{\scriptstyle\pm14.6}$ \\
FedQHD
