Figure~\ref{fig:learning_curve} shows that FedQHD
converges within 600 episodes on CartPole and LunarLander, whereas
DQN-based methods plateau earlier. This suggests that function-space
aggregation transfers more useful information per communication round
than parameter averaging in deep networks.


